      "content": "That's a pretty strong stance. You mentioned that targeted programs create \"poverty traps,\" but wouldn't a universal system be incredibly inefficient and fiscally irresponsible since you're giving money to people who don't actually need it? How do you justify the massive cost of UBI over a more precise, data-driven approach?",
