      "content": "I see. So you're basically saying the administrative savings and the \"dignity\" aspect outweigh the actual math of the budget. But if we're talking about long-term stability, eventually the tax burden required to fund a universal program might trigger its own kind of economic instability or massive capital flight. Aren't you ignoring the risk that a UBI could actually destabilize the economy it's trying to protect?",
